OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785287886
OL,3,CFourth heatwave of year to peak with
OL,4,Ctemperatures of up to 35C
OL,6,FThe fourth heatwave of the year is set
OL,7,Fto peak on Wednesday with temperatures
OL,8,Fof up to 35C, as experts warn
OL,9,Fwildfires could be "exceptionally
OL,10,Fsevere".
OL,12,FThe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)
OL,13,Fhas issued an amber heat-health alert
OL,14,Ffor the East Midlands, the East, South
OL,15,FEast and London.
OL,17,FThe alert is in place from Tuesday to
OL,18,FThursday, and the agency warned that
OL,19,Frising temperatures may increase
OL,20,Fhealth risks, particularly for
OL,21,Fvulnerable groups.
OL,26,@qD@TOUrD@GO]
