CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785287886
OL,3,CFourth heatwave of year to peak with
OL,4,Ctemperatures of up to 35C
OL,6,FTemperatures are expected to peak as
OL,7,Fhigh as 35C across south-east England
OL,8,Fon Wednesday.
OL,10,FA Met Office assessment showed fires
OL,11,Fcould be exceptionally severe by
OL,12,FWednesday if they start in parts of
OL,13,FLondon, the South East and eastern
OL,14,FEngland, as a result of the hot, dry
OL,15,Fconditions.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
