OL,3,CFourth heatwave of year to peak with
OL,4,Ctemperatures of up to 35C
OL,6,FFire and rescue services in England
OL,7,Fand Wales have responded to 706
OL,8,Fwildfires so far in 2026, with 208
OL,9,Fincidents recorded between July 16 and
OL,10,F28 alone, the National Fire Chiefs
OL,11,FCouncil (NFCC) said.
OL,13,FIt added that the latest figures,
OL,14,Fwhich do not account for wildfires
OL,15,Facross the rest of the UK such as a
OL,16,Fmajor wildfire in the Cairngorms in
OL,17,FScotland, show "how quickly wildfire
OL,18,Factivity can increase during prolonged
OL,19,Fperiods of hot and dry weather".
OL,26,@yD@POU{D@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
