PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785287886
OL,3,CFourth heatwave of year to peak with
OL,4,Ctemperatures of up to 35C
OL,6,FFire chiefs warned that wildfire risk
OL,7,F"remains elevated across the UK", with
OL,8,Fthe NFCC adding there were "currently
OL,9,Feight live wildfire incidents being
OL,10,Fmonitored through national reporting
OL,11,Fsystems".
OL,13,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,14,Fsaid firefighters were continuing to
OL,15,F"make progress at the major wildfire
OL,16,Fincident at Tintwistle Moor" after 60
OL,17,Fpersonnel were deployed on Tuesday.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@`O]pD@\OUsD@HO]wD@AOUxD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
