OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785287886
OL,3,CFourth heatwave of year to peak with
OL,4,Ctemperatures of up to 35C
OL,6,FWhile wildfire numbers in England and
OL,7,FWales remain below the 788 recorded by
OL,8,Fthe same point last year, fire chiefs
OL,9,Fwarned "continued dry conditions,
OL,10,Fcombined with warmer temperatures and
OL,11,Fharvesting activity in many rural
OL,12,Fareas", were creating conditions in
OL,13,Fwhich fires can start and spread
OL,14,Frapidly.
OL,16,FImages showed widespread brown grass
OL,17,Facross Blackheath in London, with
OL,18,Fparched dry grass present in many
OL,19,Fparks in the capital following the hot
OL,20,Fweather.
OL,26,@qD@HOUtD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
